msgstr ""
"Esta API se mantiene por compatibilidad con versiones anteriores: en su "
"lugar debe utilizarse la "
"configuración :c:member:`PyConfig.pathconfig_warnings`, ver :ref:`Python "
"Initialization Configuration <init-config>`."

#: ../../c-api/interp-lifecycle.rst:145
msgid "Private flag used by ``_freeze_module`` and ``frozenmain`` programs."
msgstr ""
"Bandera privada utilizada por los programas ``_freeze_module`` y "
"``frozenmain``."

#: ../../c-api/interp-lifecycle.rst:152
msgid ""
"This API is kept for backward compatibility: "
"setting :c:member:`PyConfig.hash_seed` "
