#: ../../c-api/interp-lifecycle.rst:213
msgid ""
"Run Python in isolated mode. In isolated mode :data:`sys.path` contains "
"neither the script's directory nor the user's site-packages directory."
msgstr ""
"Ejecutar Python en modo aislado. En modo aislado :data:`sys.path` no "
"contiene ni el directorio del script ni el directorio site-packages del "
"usuario."

#: ../../c-api/interp-lifecycle.rst:216
msgid "Set by the :option:`-I` option."
msgstr "Fijado por la opción :option:`-I`."

#: ../../c-api/interp-lifecycle.rst:225
msgid ""
"This API is kept for backward compatibility: "
"setting :c:member:`PyPreConfig.legacy_windows_fs_encoding` should be used "
